    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="be56e2c2-6afc-5ab3-a0bb-64c03ab9f445" activityNameId="dd063fef-d981-55b2-8a90-2371b9be941b" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Water treatment plant, deionisation</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Water treatment plant, deionisation
Data for infrastructure based on weak data and various assumtions. Therfore process has a large uncertainty for the equipment used.;
UUID: 310e3a98-694e-3969-9783-1c2da129d150
strong acidic cation and strong base anion resin, material used for plant, transport of materials , land use of pant, no menergy for the manufacturing included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Plant with a production of  100 m3/h. Two-bed system with a strong acidic cation resin volume of 5.3 m3 and a strong base anion resin volume of 2.8 m3. Unit is operated with counterflow regeneration, a defgasser and without lime decarbonation. Life time of the unit 15 y and of the resin 5 y. 7500 h/a operating time. Tank material stainless steel, lining PP. 
Time period: Time of literature publication. Measurements took place partly before this period.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data for resin volume based on design calculations for the specified water quality. Material demand estimated based on very weak data (one source). Land use estimated from literature data (one source). Standard distances used for transports. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_310e3a98-694e-3969-9783-1c2da129d150.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
